OL,3,GNEWSACouncil commits to talks about
OL,4,Aflights return
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has committed to start talks
OL,7,Faimed at returning commercial flights
OL,8,Fto its region.
OL,10,FCarlisle airport, in Cumbria, started
OL,11,Frunning commercial routes in 2019 after
OL,12,Fa 25-year hiatus, but stopped operating
OL,13,Fthem in 2020 due to the coronavirus
OL,14,Fpandemic and they never resumed.
OL,16,FIn a motion approved at a meeting on
OL,17,FTuesday, Cumberland Council committed
OL,18,Fto engaging with the airport owners,
OL,19,Fthe government and other local
OL,20,Fauthorities to support a return of
OL,21,Fcommercial flights to the region.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
